# What NOT to upload to EAS Build.
#
# WHY: without this file EAS falls back to .gitignore, which meant shipping every tracked
# file -- including ~166MB of audit screen recordings under refs/ -- producing a 304MB
# archive that has to be compressed and uploaded on EVERY build.
#
# NOTE: .easignore REPLACES .gitignore for EAS, it does not extend it. So the usual
# build/vendor excludes have to be repeated here or they come back.

# --- standard excludes (would be covered by .gitignore, must be restated) ---
node_modules/
.git/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
ios/build/
ios/Pods/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env*.local

# --- never ship credentials ---
.secrets/
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
credentials.json

# --- dev-only research artifacts: the actual 166MB ---
refs/
screenshots/
scripts/anim/
*.mp4
*.gif
